        "question_e6ab89": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What is the warranty period?",
            "answer": "<p>There's a two years limnited warranty on electronics and mechanical parts within the US, and 6 months for the battery. Register the serial number at <a href=\"/pages/warranty\" title=\"Warranty\">ensoshisha.com/warranty</a> within 30 days of purchase to activate coverage.</p>"
