            "answer": "<p>Extra batteries • Set of 3 ceramic cups • Thermocap •Set of 2 Flower Cup<br/>• Glass Collar • 20-/50-pack disposable cups •Gold-plated herb cup •Wax<br/>cup • Acrylic water tank with extended dip tube •Travel bag • 1.5 m hose<br/>& magnetic mouthpiece • Mouthpiece extension • Cup removal tool •<br/>Replacement glass & dip tube • Mesh screen kit • Scrub tool • Straps<br/>(See ▶ <a href=\"/collections/accesories\" title=\"Accessories\">Accessories</a>)</p>"
