            "answer": "<p>Yes. Use the ceramic cup with the mesh screen and wax pad, or add<br/>accessories:<br/>• Gold-plated herb cup – up to 1.5g at 260 °C+<br/>• Glass wax cup or cotton pad for oils; activate G-Mode.<br/>(<a href=\"https://youtu.be/cwhyL0X4rDA?si=KElvmvv5ao6nzR6U\" target=\"_blank\">Watch ▶ Herb Mode)</a></p>"
